1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:04,400
(Howard:)It means after we play handball,
I'm showering at home.

2
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:09,620
(Sheldon:)Good morning, Friend Howard.

3
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:10,920
(Sheldon:)Friend Raj.

4
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,460
(Sheldon:)I see you gentlemen
are enjoying beverages.

5
00:00:13,460 --> 00:00:16,860
(Sheldon:)Perhaps they would taste better
out of these.

6
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:20,200
"World's Greatest
Astrophysicist"?

7
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,760
(Sheldon:)Don't thank me. You earned it.

8
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:27,200
"Howard Wolowitz."

9
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:31,270
(Howard:)Why not
"World's Greatest Engineer"?

10
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:32,370
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.

11
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:34,110
(Sheldon:)I typed that
into the label maker,

12
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:35,440
(Sheldon:)but I just couldn't press enter.

13
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,630
(Sheldon:)Now down to business.

14
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:40,820
(Sheldon:)What would it take for you
to abandon Leonard

15
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,350
(Sheldon:)and join me in a rival company?

16
00:00:42,350 --> 00:00:44,520
(Sheldon:)Unless, of course,
the mugs are sufficient,

17
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:47,060
(Sheldon:)in which case, welcome aboard.

18
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:49,220
(Howard:)We're not quitting on Leonard.

19
00:00:49,230 --> 00:00:52,060
(Sheldon:)I understand.
Your loyalty is admirable.

20
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:55,700
(Sheldon:)But what if I were
to up the ante?

21
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:57,870
(Raj:)What are you talking about?

22
00:00:57,870 --> 00:01:00,400
(Sheldon:)Monogrammed key chains

